OL,3,AJensen Huang: Why a personal scandal
OL,4,Afor the face of the AI boom has
OL,5,Aprovoked a national security scare
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang is one of the technology
OL,8,Findustry's most high-profile figures.
OL,10,FHe rose to prominence as the business
OL,11,Fhe leads - artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,12,Fchip giant Nvidia - became one of the
OL,13,Fworld's most valuable companies.
OL,15,FAs the face of the AI boom, Huang also
OL,16,Fbecame close to Donald Trump as the
OL,17,Fpresident pushed for the US to keep its
OL,18,Fdominance of the technology over China.
